    "body": "OWNER_VISIBLE_SCENE_PROTOTYPE_R02 — REAL 3D HUMAN SURFACE / NOT DRAWN\n\nSTATE = VISIBLE LOCAL 3D PROTOTYPE / NOT BABYLON PASS / NOT CANON\nOWNER_DIRECTIVE = build only the scene; do not use drawing/imitation\n\nSOURCE_BODY:\n- exact B0 GLB bytes = 1,492,580\n- local SHA256 = 626be02ae16ddf2bfd8760633761489a3c24f5b35d1e5b3f4a0c9a602cbffaf0 (matches B0 #17 durable evidence)\n- original mesh = 21,833 vertices / 36,972 triangles\n- helper geometry removed using the pinned OxiHuman `body_vertex_boundary` method from commit 603b446854c3d5a9ca478214e7b85008d54786b9\n- resulting body-only surface = 14,517 vertices / 26,756 triangles\n- body-only metric extents after OxiHuman dm→m conversion = [1.02870045, 1.71857119, 0.43325233] m\n\nSCENE:\n- renderer for this local visible preview = VTK 9.6.2 real 3D rasterization (NOT a 2D/PIL drawing path)\n- actors = 2 instances of the body-only surface\n- material = neutral white/grey physically-lit surface\n- stage = physical 3D floor/back wall/architectural frame/practicals\n- camera = perspective, 40° vertical FOV, position [0, 1.03, 3.18], target [0, 0.94, 0]\n- actor centers = x ±0.72 m; yaw ∓8°\n- lighting = actual 3D scene key/fill/rim/front lift; framebuffer capture only; no painted character/post-drawn anatomy\n- output = 1280×720 PNG\n- output SHA256 = 271e89023cc7d8294172cff9d272fc864ba994802696d53a5b35bbe51a609a8a\n\nIMPORTANT BOUNDARY:\nThis is an immediate OWNER-visible 3D scene prototype proving the corrected geometry path. It is not evidence that the Babylon #221 branch has been updated, and it does not claim Babylon CI PASS, DUNCAN QC, merge, canon, or production integration.\n\nPREVIOUS REJECTED 2D MANNEQUIN PNG remains FAIL / DO NOT USE.",
